    description: "Phase 2 of the ADR-0006 Return-Type Registry Pre-Pass. Extends the registry built in Phase 1 (WI-kuroj) to two more analyzers with existing var_types infrastructure. Smaller delta than Phase 1.\n\nDELIVERABLES:\n(1) New 'signatures' YAML in kotlin.yaml: function_node_types (function_declaration, primary_constructor), name_field, return_type_field. Tier 2 escape hatches in signatures.py kotlin_extract(): nullable suffix strip ('Foo?' → 'Foo'); generic erasure (handled by Tier 1).\n\n(2) New 'signatures' YAML in csharp.yaml: function_node_types (method_declaration, constructor_declaration), name_field, return_type_field. Tier 2 escape hatches in signatures.py csharp_extract(): async unwrapping ('Task<T>' → 'T', 'ValueTask<T>' → 'T', 'IAsyncEnumerable<T>' → 'T').\n\n(3) Wire registry into kotlin.py and csharp.py var_types fill loops (same pattern as Phase 1 wiring).\n\n(4) Regression tests in tests/test_kotlin_signature_registry.py and tests/test_csharp_signature_registry.py covering the per-language Tier 2 escape hatches.\n\n(5) Bakeoff validation: re-run kserve (Kotlin) and aspnet (C#) deep-bakeoff after Phase 2.\n\nPREREQUISITE: Phase 1 (WI-kuroj) must be complete because this WI extends signatures.py and reuses its registry plumbing."  # 3e5c
